{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16980","headline":"秋日台中寄怀简诸僚 · 武元衡","name":"秋日台中寄怀简诸僚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宪府日多事，秋光照碧林。\n干云岩翠合，布石地苔深。\n忧悔耿遐抱，尘埃缁素襟。\n物情牵局促，友道旷招寻。\n颓节风霜变，流年芳景侵。\n池荷足幽气，烟竹又繁阴。\n簪组赤墀恋，池鱼沧海心。\n涤烦滞幽赏，永度瑶华音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}